  "details": "At https://vrchat.com/home/playermoderations there are five lists\n\n* Blocks\n\n* interactOns\n\n* mutes (people I've muted voice chat)\n\n* muteChats (chatbox)\n\n* unmutes\n\nTwo of these aren't labeled, interactOns and muteChats, please label them\n\nThree of the categories I can't remove individual items via the website. interactOns, muteChats, unmutes. Not really needed, I was just going to pare down my interactOns list.\n\nI can tell which list is which via the tooltip on the clear all buttons, but yeah, please label the lists when you have a chance.",
